LOGGING 9, brlog.txt
drive c:,..,\,\brweb ! c: is the folder above this one; \brweb must match this folder's name
wbserver c:\brweb
workstack 500000
flowstack 1250
printscreen newpage
rpnstack 10000
keyboard 03,01
style i 3, l mixed, c mixed, k lower
option 6
option 8
option 14
option 26
option 43
option 60
option 84
rem option 66 passphrase
style indent 3 comments mixed
Baseyear 1950
wsid=unique
application_name BR Web Server
date never
gui off
substitute prn:/10 preview:/default
printer type NWP select preview:
printer NWP INIT "\E&l0O\E(s2b4102t17H\E&l66p7.6C"  ! portrait compressed ###########
execute "run web_server"
